SY_TALK("J4a_zUQG-l8",[[383,["Today we have gathered here to do","Guru puja."]],[390,["This system started long time back","in India,"]],[394,["I think even at the time of Patanjali,"]],[399,["maybe even earlier, when there were","great seekers."]],[406,["And their gurus were sitting","in the jungles, where they used to get"]],[414,["permission to go there and then","they would get their realisation,"]],[419,["very few of them, one or two."]],[422,["So we had many rishis and munis","in the olden times in India."]],[428,["So this system of guru started."]],[433,["Also one of the reasons is that, that there","is no organised religion in India."]],[441,["There’s no popes, there are no priests,","nothing like them."]],[447,["They have priests just for worshipping","in the temples."]],[451,["But for giving realisation, for talking","about higher life,"]],[459,["they all had to go to very great","realised souls."]],[468,["And it was absolutely the freedom of the","guru, whom to accept whom not to accept."]],[475,["And everybody was tested thoroughly","by the guru"]],[480,["if they are capable of achieving","Self-realisation or not."]],[488,["And this test was so hard, so difficult,"]],[495,["and also to a point of cruelty, that very","few could pass through that test."]],[504,["It’s not like Sahaja Yoga, everybody is","a Sahaja Yogi, it’s not like that."]],[510,["That, of course, made it a very narrow","margin for people"]],[517,["to achieve their realisation and these","gurus never used to leave"]],[524,["their own seats, they call it takiya","(meaning: pillow)."]],[527,["They would be there in their own place,","all those who would like to go to him"]],[531,["could come. If he allowed, then only","they can meet him."]],[539,["You may go on for miles together, nothing,"]],[542,["no obligations of the guru that he should","meet you."]],[550,["Perhaps they didn’t feel that love and","compassion for the seekers."]],[560,["They didn’t understand that these seekers","are ardently seeking the truth"]],[567,["and they should not suffer."]],[570,["That may be the reason they were not","so much concerned."]],[577,["All the time they were testing","their disciple."]],[581,["Even Ramdas, who was the guru of Shivaji,"]],[585,["was testing even Shivaji for so many times,"]],[589,["though he was a born realised."]],[594,["So to get this Gurupada, to [the] position","of a guru,"]],[599,["after that they had to work very, very hard","to achieve a state of a saint."]],[611,["But in Sahaja Yoga that is not the case,","as you know."]],[617,["I just thought – if people get their","realisation,"]],[621,["they’ll see for themselves what’s wrong","with them,"]],[624,["they will introspect themselves and will","try to correct themselves."]],[630,["It is true, for many, many people, but some","of them still are lingering behind"]],[638,["and are going on and on and on thinking","that they are Sahaja Yogis,"]],[642,["they have achieved a lot, they are","something very special."]],[648,["So this delusion is all the time","is creating this problem."]],[653,["This delusion makes them very","narrow minded,"]],[661,["selfish, self-centred, and people can’t","believe how can they be Sahaja Yogis."]],[672,["So the first and foremost thing we have","to know"]],[675,["that this Sahaja Yoga has worked out","because Paramchaitanya"]],[681,["is transmitting compassion. It never","did before."]],[686,["It never had that kind of an attitude","which it is there because I am a Mother."]],[695,["And this compassion has worked it this way","that: you all have got your realisation,"]],[700,["you have achieved a state which we can","call as a Self-realised souls."]],[706,["But still, because you got it so easily,","cheaply,"]],[713,["I think, still we don’t realise what we","have got."]],[719,["Still we do not practice meditation,","introspection and dedication."]],[729,["Some are very much there,"]],[733,["but mostly we are just living in the idea","that we have already achieved."]],[742,["So, the first thing we should introspect:"]],[748,["Are we concerned about ourselves?"]],[755,["All the time do we think that we are","suffering,"]],[759,["we have this problem, that problem,"]],[763,["or this should be done, that should","be done."]],[767,["If the attention is on that, that all","the time you are worried about yourself,"]],[776,["then you cannot break, you cannot break","through this shell of your being,"]],[783,["which is under the domination of your","mental selfishness or self-centredness."]],[793,["Even self-centredness is absolutely","against your growth."]],[799,["There are many people who come,","I have seen, even to Cabella,"]],[803,["I know they have to suffer a lot because","they think"]],[807,["it’s a very open space where they have","to live"]],[811,["and they must make all arrangements","to make themselves comfortable."]],[815,["Such people have to grow still much more."]],[818,["For a saint, any place has to be heavenly."]],[823,["You must have seen Me enjoying everything."]],[828,["I can live anywhere, I can sleep anywhere.","I have no demands of any kind."]],[834,["But if you are worried about your body","comforts or your body troubles"]],[843,["then still you are at a body level, which","you have to transcend."]],[849,["Worried about how you look, how you","dress up,"]],[854,["what sort of things you have to wear:"]],[859,["all this makes you yet not a good","Sahaja Yogi."]],[869,["This is one style of Sahaja Yogis who","still want very great comforts."]],[877,["So, what you have to do, if you are used","to comforts:"]],[883,["try to go and sleep on the street."]],[888,["I will not do that, but you can do it.","Or sleep on a tree."]],[894,["You may fall down, doesn’t matter."]],[903,["Do all kinds of things that are necessary","to punish your body to understand"]],[908,["that you are not bound with this comfort","of the body."]],[915,["This is one of the greatest things one","has to see,"]],[919,["that you are not bound by your body."]],[923,["It’s alright - if you have comfort, well","and good, if you don’t have, well and good."]],[928,["For a Sahaja Yogi it is very important that","he should be able to live like a saint."]],[935,["Not necessarily that you should become","a sanyasi,"]],[939,["but from inside your body should be such","that you can dominate your body."]],[948,["How can you not sleep anywhere?","Why can you not sleep anywhere?"]],[956,["Then also, that they want to have a very","comfortable arrangements"]],[965,["about bathrooms, this, that."]],[970,["All these ideas are there because you are","very self-conscious"]],[976,["but not superconsciousness, it’s not there."]],[980,["You want to have everything first class,"]],[983,["and anybody who tries to interfere with","that kind of a thing, you don’t like it."]],[989,["I can understand a person who is very old –","he cannot manage things,"]],[994,["he has to have a certain amount","of body comfort,"]],[1000,["but even young people these days are","extremely comfort-oriented."]],[1008,["That is not for Sahaja Yoga."]],[1013,["Of course, I’ve seen people in the West","are better off in this matter."]],[1019,["Because when they go to India they told Me","they like"]],[1022,["[Maharashtra] S.T. buses better than","comfortable buses."]],[1026,["So I said, “Why?”"]],[1028,["“Because Mother, you can jump in the bus","nicely with all the luggage,”"]],[1033,["“Because the windows are open, you can","breathe. Very natural, very good”."]],[1040,["And they wanted to go on bullock carts","also. I mean they enjoy all that."]],[1045,["Actually if you see you'll notice,","in the Western World mostly,"]],[1050,["people are taking to [a] more rustic life."]],[1053,["They are enjoying more the rustic style","of life"]],[1056,["than to this so-called comfortable,","artificial life."]],[1060,["Not so much Indians, I would say,","also Malaysians."]],[1066,["I think, most of the people I have met","in the Western countries are really great"]],[1074,["because they can sleep anywhere,","they can eat anything."]],[1079,["You ask them, “How did you like the food?”","“What did we eat, I don’t know Mother?”"]],[1085,["That is the sign. That is the sign","of a person"]],[1090,["who is not bothered as to what he","is eating, what he’s getting,"]],[1096,["what is his taste, “I like this, I like","that,” these words drop out."]],[1105,["It’s not difficult, it’s not difficult,"]],[1109,["you might think that I am asking you to do","something, hazardous thing, you see."]],[1114,["It’s not difficult at all. Because if you","have to impress"]],[1119,["the people around, you have to be","like a saint."]],[1123,["And if you are a fussy person, if you are","a fusspot,"]],[1128,["then you cannot impress others that you","have got Self-realisation."]],[1135,["Many people tell Me, “Mother, people","had to do so much:"]],[1138,["to go to Himalayas, do this, do that,","and then they got their realisation."]],[1144,["How is it these people you have blessed?”","Even some great saints asked Me that."]],[1149,["“What right they had to get this","realisation?"]],[1153,["Why did you give them realisation?","What have they achieved?”"]],[1157,["I said, “Only their desire."]],[1159,["Their desire was very much there that","they should get their Self-realisation"]],[1164,["and that’s how they got it”."]],[1167,["But now to go into only desire,","is not sufficient."]],[1176,["You have to depend on your Self,"]],[1179,["on the light of your Spirit you should see","what’s wrong with you."]],[1183,["This is a very important thing.","Ask questions to yourself."]],[1188,["“Why do I want this? Why do I need this?","What is the purpose?”"]],[1194,["Because as you have seen, all the rest","of the world is mad,"]],[1199,["[we] call it mad, because they are","running after stupid things,"]],[1206,["they are wanting things which","has no meaning to spirituality."]],[1212,["So spirituality itself should be","self-satisfying."]],[1217,["If you are spiritually endowed, then you","are self-satisfied."]],[1222,["And this self-satisfaction within you","will lead you"]],[1228,["to that Ocean of Joy about which","I have been telling you"]],[1233,["and all the Scriptures have described."]],[1238,["For Sahaja Yogis, the word we use","is Nirananda."]],[1244,["Nirananda means: A joyous state, where","nothing is needed."]],[1252,["Joy itself is joy. You are enjoying","only joy."]],[1258,["Nothing is needed to make you happy."]],[1261,["You are happy because of joy that you have,","in the Nirananda state."]],[1269,["If you go and see how these saints lived,","you will be amazed."]],[1276,["How they managed their life, you’ll be","very much amazed."]],[1281,["How many days they used to fast,","without food."]],[1285,["Never bothered! They never thought","it was fasting."]],[1287,["They just used to think, “We have no food,","so no, don’t eat.”"]],[1292,["Of course, you don’t have to go through","[that], you have got your realisation."]],[1297,["So now you have a power to achieve","this mastery."]],[1302,["Now you have this power."]],[1305,["The another thing I have noticed","about Sahaja Yogis,"]],[1310,["some of them have grudges about others."]],[1316,["Sahaja Yoga is"]],[1322,["the blessings of love, blessings","of compassion."]],[1331,["There is no place for any kind of hatred,"]],[1337,["or any kind of revenge, or anger","among Sahaja Yogis."]],[1346,["If you have that, you must conquer it."]],[1350,["Is a good chance, if you find somebody","who is very hot-tempered,"]],[1358,["who is a very angry type, go and make","friends with that person."]],[1364,["Just see if you can carry on with that","person or not."]],[1368,["If there’s a fusspot, also make friends","with such a fusspot,"]],[1373,["and see that you achieve that peace"]],[1380,["which will keep you above all kinds","of hatred,"]],[1384,["all kinds of temper, which is a very","bad thing."]],[1389,["But some Sahaja Yogis lose their temper","very fast."]],[1393,["I would say they cannot be Sahaja Yogis,"]],[1395,["because if you have no control over","your anger,"]],[1401,["then how are you powerful of compassion","and love?"]],[1406,["But you don’t even have to control it –","just there."]],[1411,["Once you have it, you have that state,","then you just watch and see."]],[1417,["In the olden days, the saints, mostly, used","to be very much angry type people."]],[1425,["They couldn’t bear the stupidity","of the world"]],[1429,["and they used to be very, very angry type","and they used to run away from people."]],[1435,["I know of a saint, Nityanandswami, who","always lived on the tree,"]],[1442,["and anybody tried to come near him,","he used to throw stones at him."]],[1446,["Couldn’t bear people who were all","heated up and coming to him."]],[1453,["But you don’t need that. You have a way","of achieving"]],[1458,["love and affection of the people who seem","to be very, very troublesome"]],[1465,["and grudging type or maybe some people","who are very aggressive."]],[1471,["This is not a difficult task if you try","a little bit the other way round."]],[1476,["Mostly people, when they find somebody","who is a very hot-tempered person,"]],[1481,["they run away from them. «We don’t want","to have anything to do [with them]»."]],[1486,["Those who are not hot-tempered, those","who are good natured,"]],[1495,["you can always be friendly, what is","so great about it?"]],[1500,["What is so nice about it?","What is so sweet about it?"]],[1512,["But how you speak to the person, how you","talk to that person,"]],[1517,["how you manage that person: your love","will definitely melt him down,"]],[1525,["because he’s a Sahaja Yogi, I’m not saying","for non-sahaja yogis."]],[1530,["Sahaja Yogis as they are, you have","to be extremely"]],[1536,["compassionate and affectionate","and love."]],[1544,["The another thing which is extremely","important for us to know,"]],[1549,["that we have got this realisation","through Mother’s love."]],[1555,["Only My compassion has acted,"]],[1558,["only the power of Mother’s compassion","could have worked it out."]],[1562,["Now, even if this love is flowing towards","the stones,"]],[1568,["or towards the mountains, or towards","anything which is very solid,"]],[1575,["the ripples come back, they have","to come back."]],[1580,["In the same way, you people now,","who have got realisation,"]],[1585,["have to know that compassion and love"]],[1588,["is the only power you have got,","nothing else."]],[1594,["If you love yourself, you care","for yourself,"]],[1599,["you care for your family and care","for your children –"]],[1604,["then you haven’t achieved much."]],[1607,["You are only worried about yourself,"]],[1611,["because that’s your limited area","where you move."]],[1616,["But if you can break that and find out","places"]],[1624,["where you have to express your love,","you can."]],[1630,["As they say, the water finds it’s own","level."]],[1633,["In the same way, this compassion has","to flow to all the places,"]],[1639,["to all the ditches everywhere,","and should find its own level."]],[1645,["But if you are just satisfied with yourself","and you are not bothered,"]],[1652,["you are just trying to believe that you are","a great soul because you are a Sahaja Yogi,"]],[1661,["then I must say that you are sadly","mistaken."]],[1666,["In this lifetime you can achieve","that state."]],[1670,["In this lifetime you can get to that state","within yourself."]],[1679,["Now, the third thing that troubles","Sahaja Yogis is that"]],[1682,["“Mother, we want God’s realisation,”","that makes Me laugh."]],[1688,["You see, it is already there, already","there."]],[1694,["Like once you get into the sea"]],[1697,["and you say, “Mother, we want to go","to the bottom of the sea,”"]],[1700,["you can always go, just slip,","and you will be there."]],[1704,["In the same way, once you have developed","a kind of a Self-realisation"]],[1713,["and have jumped into the Ocean","of this compassion,"]],[1718,["there’s no need to achieve anything."]],[1721,["The sense of achievement, “I should be","that, I should be this,”"]],[1725,["is all coming from your human haunting."]],[1729,["That should be over. Now you are","Godly people."]],[1733,["So you should not think, “I should achieve","this state, I should achieve that state,”"]],[1737,["but just go on slipping, just giving up all","the weights that you have in your heads"]],[1743,["and it will work out. This is what I have","been saying to you that:"]],[1750,["you have to dissolve yourself","into the compassion."]],[1757,["Also, there are still some very people","who want to be in the front."]],[1764,["Specially Indians will all sit together","in front, I’ve seen that way."]],[1770,["They have no right, they have no right","to sit in front."]],[1776,["Nobody has right to sit in front or to seek","a place."]],[1783,["They should sit wherever they get seat","to sit down with complete satisfaction."]],[1791,["Whether you sit in front or at that corner,","even in the darkness,"]],[1796,["you can get My vibrations, you can get","everything."]],[1801,["So to be prominent, to sit some place where","you are prominent, is not necessary."]],[1811,["What is it in a prominence, what do","you get?"]],[1814,["To be lost into the crowds, to be lost","into the Ocean of Love is the main thing."]],[1825,["All these are mythical that, we should","somehow or other get the front place."]],[1832,["You see as Marathi apan manto (We say),","“Samor chi zaaga patkauli mi!”"]],[1842,["means “I have managed to get the front","seat!”"]],[1847,["Front will be the back, and back will be","the front."]],[1854,["It is very surprising how still people","are trying"]],[1860,["to achieve something so nonsensical."]],[1865,["So where is your mind, where is your","attention, what are you thinking?"]],[1870,["If you are thoughtless you'll be satisfied,","you'll be happy,"]],[1876,["you'll not ask for anything, you’ll not","want anything."]],[1881,["What is there to have? What is","so important?"]],[1888,["All these ideas come from ignorance, I must","tell you, is from ignorance."]],[1892,["Once this ‘Hare Rama Hare Krishna’ fellow","came to Me."]],[1896,["And he said that, “We have heard you","are a great saint,"]],[1901,["this thing, that thing, and you have","all the comforts of life –"]],[1905,["you have everything here, very nice,","this thing, that thing."]],[1910,["So, how are you a saint?”","I said, “How are you a saint?”"]],[1915,["[He said,] “I have given up my family,","I have given up my cars,"]],[1922,["I have given up my house, I have given up","my children.”"]],[1928,["I said, “One more thing you have given up”,","he said, “What?” “Your brains!”"]],[1943,["So they said, “But how do you say we have","given up our brains?”"]],[1945,["I said, “Very simple, I’ve given up","nothing, because I am holding nothing."]],[1952,["What is there to give up when you are","not holding anything?"]],[1956,["Now, I would say in this house,","or on my body, anywhere,"]],[1962,["[if] you think you can find anything equal","to the dust particle"]],[1967,["of Shri Krishna, you can take it.","Should be equal though.”"]],[1976,["Now they started looking here and there."]],[1979,["I said, “Then what have you given up?","Just stones! What have you given up?"]],[1985,["Why are you boasting about giving up that,","and giving up this and giving up…?”"]],[1989,["They even shaved their head. What is it?"]],[1994,["All these useless ideas that, “We have done","this, we have done that.”"]],[2000,["Anybody in Sahaja Yoga who thinks he","is doing a lot of work for Sahaja Yoga,"]],[2003,["should give up completely."]],[2008,["That’s the sign of another ignorance."]],[2012,["If you are part and parcel of the Ocean,"]],[2016,["everything is done by Ocean, you are","doing nothing."]],[2020,["To have such ideas about yourself shows","how little you know about yourself."]],[2028,["You are the Ocean. Now, if you are","the Ocean how can you claim,"]],[2033,["“I have touched this shore, I have touched","that shore, I have touched this shore”?"]],[2037,["No more “I” is left. Once this I-ness","drops out,"]],[2043,["then only the Universal Being within you","shines."]],[2050,["All these things are so clearly evident","in our characters."]],[2061,["Some people are very identified, say","with their country,"]],[2067,["or maybe with their worshipping style,","whatever it is."]],[2074,["All these misidentifications have to be","given up."]],[2079,["It’s very difficult for people because","they are so conditioned."]],[2082,["And as long as you have conditioning","you cannot rise above your mind,"]],[2089,["which is a myth, you cannot."]],[2092,["Now, try to understand what are","your conditionings are."]],[2102,["One of them, I would say, I have seen","and I am so surprised,"]],[2106,["you go to the Western countries, all","of them only sing songs of Shri Ganesha."]],[2113,["They know all the songs of Shri Ganesha,"]],[2116,["Shri Ganesha’s photographs, Shri Ganesha’s","everything, children also."]],[2121,["And now I have seen that vibrations stop!"]],[2124,["Why should they stop? Why should Ganesha","stop the vibrations?"]],[2128,["Why they are doing it, I realised, was","because I said"]],[2131,["Shri Ganesha incarnated as Christ."]],[2135,["Their identification is with Christ and","Christianity, in a very subtle way."]],[2144,["So all the vibrations stopped! Imagine","with Shri Ganesha’s music, we heard"]],[2151,["in one of the Eastern Block countries,","and all the vibrations had stopped"]],[2157,["and they were singing all the songs,","all the songs of Shri Ganesha,"]],[2160,["not one song of Sahaja Yoga, leave alone","about the Guru, not one song."]],[2171,["So, even this, there is a very subtle,","subtle identification."]],[2177,["There was one fellow in Russia, supposed","to be very intelligent,"]],[2187,["he said that, “Alright, if we keep Mother’s","photograph and also the icons,"]],[2191,["we can get the same type of vibrations.”","You cannot,"]],[2197,["because icons are made by some artist’s","imaginary."]],[2202,["These are not representing actually"]],[2205,["even Maria or Christ or anyone, they are","all, all imaginary."]],[2210,["If Italian ones makes Christ, he is","Italian style,"]],[2216,["if somebody - French one makes, he is","thin like [a] Frenchman,"]],[2222,["if you get somebody, say from Holland,","he'll have a forehead like that."]],[2231,["You see all of them, they depict Christ","as they want to."]],[2237,["Then we have Maria the same way.","Her expression, her photograph, everything,"]],[2245,["is all according to the imagination","of the artist"]],[2249,["and to whatever country he belongs,","that he will do."]],[2255,["And they are not free, you can see,","they are not free,"]],[2258,["because all these artists have a certain","style."]],[2263,["Now if it is Rembrandt, it’s a style,"]],[2266,["if it is, say Leonardo, it’s a style."]],[2270,["Though they are born realised, still","they have a style. Nobody is like this,"]],[2275,["that he’ll make today like this, tomorrow","like this: there’s no freedom."]],[2280,["They are bound by their own styles."]],[2285,["Everybody has one style, and that is","the style they follow."]],[2291,["Because, what is the reason? Reason is,","they must have done 3, 4 types of styles,"]],[2298,["must have done, sure, but people must","have rejected,"]],[2303,["“This is no good, this is no good.” So","it's all, you see, opinion of the people."]],[2309,["So they must have taken to one style:","alright, this is the style."]],[2313,["So you can see Christ if he’s Japanese,","he’ll have chinky eyes,"]],[2322,["if he’s Chinese, he’ll have no nose,"]],[2327,["if it’s Indian, he’ll be dark. So all kinds","of Christs I have seen"]],[2333,["and I feel that, how can they emit","vibrations? Tell Me."]],[2341,["While with My photograph, how can you","compare?"]],[2344,["Also, cameras were to be developed at this","time: do you notice that point?"]],[2350,["Cameras were developed at this time,","not before that."]],[2355,["This loudspeaker was not developed","before this."]],[2360,["Aeroplanes were not developed before.","I have been travelling for 19 days,"]],[2366,["one day in the plane, second day","in the public programme."]],[2370,["They could not do all that. Nobody could","do this."]],[2376,["Neither Shri Krishna, nor anyone."]],[2379,["They could not fly by aeroplane","in those days."]],[2384,["Now we say we have 65 countries, somebody","says there’s “No, 68 countries”"]],[2388,["or go on correcting. But is only possible","because today, today:"]],[2394,["there are aeroplanes. They were never","there [before]."]],[2399,["So all these things are – even video, even","the way you are seeing My image there,"]],[2406,["was that available before? No."]],[2412,["So this is a very special time, where","science has also supported"]],[2419,["seekers to find the Truth – science","has supported."]],[2422,["We have to be thankful to science:"]],[2426,["that part of science which has been","so much supportive."]],[2430,["Even [if] there was not a car, I could not","have gone up to Milan even!"]],[2436,["Imagine going on a bullock cart, what would","have happened to Me?"]],[2442,["So all these things are created today","for you."]],[2448,["You were also born in those times","for this special reason."]],[2455,["They could not give realisation because","that time you were not there."]],[2462,["Very few people of your calibre were there."]],[2465,["But I wonder if you understand","your calibre."]],[2468,["The way you are sometimes growing,"]],[2474,["shows that you don’t understand","your calibre."]],[2479,["You don’t know what you are,"]],[2481,["how much the whole atmosphere has","worked out for you,"]],[2487,["the science has been worked out for you.","Science is a gift of the nature."]],[2494,["All this has been worked out for you"]],[2497,["to achieve the highest state","in the shortest time."]],[2504,["But for that, one has to be extremely","introspective."]],[2513,["Instead of thinking of what you have","to achieve: be introspective."]],[2519,["This introspection will help you and you","will really become real gurus."]],[2527,["When you go to other villages, other","places, other cities,"]],[2535,["people should know from your being itself","that some great person has come."]],[2542,["You don’t have to tell, you don’t have","to certify,"]],[2547,["it’s the simplicity of your temperament","itself."]],[2553,["First time I went to Leningrad, nobody","knew about Me."]],[2560,["No advertisements, nothing. They just","put some posters, some."]],[2567,["And there were 2000 people in the hall,","2000 outside."]],[2571,["In the hall they had to pay, alright.","I was wondering what’s the matter."]],[2576,["And when I came out I gave them realisation","but I said, “You come tomorrow“."]],[2582,["So 2000 from inside and 2000 from outside","and about 2000 more came,"]],[2588,["and were all were sitting on the ground."]],[2592,["I was amazed. I said, “What made you come","to My programme?”"]],[2600,["[They] said, “Mother, so obvious,","Your photograph!”"]],[2604,["Such sensitivity of spirituality:","“So obvious, from Your photograph!”"]],[2612,["And they were scientists, they were","doctors,"]],[2614,["they were all kinds of intelligent people."]],[2617,["But they could feel the spirituality","from the face."]],[2624,["That kind of a sensitivity we should have."]],[2629,["When you don’t need any discretion,","nothing, you know:"]],[2631,["this is this, this is this, this","is this."]],[2635,["Don’t have to judge, don’t have to think","about it."]],[2641,["You cannot say who will be best fitted","for this:"]],[2649,["those who have come for the first time,","those who have come later on,"]],[2652,["or those who will be coming, younger","or older, women, men or children."]],[2661,["It is there."]],[2665,["In my lifetime if I see so many of you,","so much transformed,"]],[2670,["looking so beautiful, so nice, creating","such a good atmosphere."]],[2676,["It’s more than satisfaction for Me."]],[2679,["And sometimes I think I - there is nothing","to be done now anymore – finished."]],[2685,["But then they invite Me here, and invite Me","there, so I’m just doing."]],[2691,["But to be very frank I am over satisfied."]],[2694,["Now, once you have planted the tree…","it’s like a mango tree."]],[2699,["Once you have planted the mango tree","and looked after it for 3 - 4 years,"]],[2704,["then it looks after itself."]],[2708,["It gives fruits, it doesn’t need any water,","nothing, it just grows by itself."]],[2714,["In the same way it should happen with you.","You should grow by yourself."]],[2721,["Of course, you will find people who are","stupid, who are aggressive,"]],[2726,["who are not at all Sahaja Yogis"]],[2730,["and trying to be Sahaja Yogis.","You’ll find all kinds."]],[2733,["So just see them, that’s all."]],[2741,["In this Guru puja, you have to decide","that what are the criteria."]],[2753,["First a Guru has to be without desires,","any desires whatsoever:"]],[2765,["Nirichcha, as they say. There is one","false guru in India"]],[2770,["who said that, “If I had the powers","as Mother has,"]],[2774,["then I would have become the king","of this world.”"]],[2778,["So people said, “Then why don’t you","become?”"]],[2782,["“Why doesn’t Mother become like that?","Why doesn’t She become the king?”"]],[2788,["So they said, “Because She is Nirichcha -","means She has no desires."]],[2791,["A person who has no desires will not","become anything.”"]],[2795,["So I said go and tell him, “If you have","desires, you cannot have powers also.”"]],[2803,["It’s only because you have no desires,","that’s why all these powers are there."]],[2809,["So any desire that comes into your mind,","you should say, “Ah, forget it."]],[2817,["Just forget it.”"]],[2819,["When the desire is overpowering,","you just divert your attention."]],[2827,["Any kind of stupid desire can take charge"]],[2832,["and how do you become desireless is","by getting to the thoughtless awareness."]],[2841,["Any crisis comes in, you should be","able to rise"]],[2844,["into that state of thoughtless awareness.","Just be peaceful."]],[2851,["Look at your desires with peace."]],[2855,["You can tell the desire, “Oh, I’m very","much satisfied, now don’t come,"]],[2858,["I don’t want.”"]],[2862,["That’s how you can become desireless."]],[2867,["There is this compassion, and","the compassion"]],[2873,["that becomes actually the power."]],[2881,["[With] small, small things you can express","your love, very small, small things."]],[2888,["In very sweet ways you can express","your love."]],[2894,["Is very important. The whole world needs","today love and peace."]],[2900,["And you have to give peace and love","to everyone that is possible."]],[2907,["Of course [with] Sahaja Yogis [it] is","very easy, but even non-sahaja yogis,"]],[2912,["you must treat them with respect and love."]],[2916,["But you should not have a desire that","you should get back anything from them."]],[2924,["It’s alright, whatever done, is forgotten."]],[2927,["You have known so many Sahaja Yogis who","came to Sahaja Yoga, have gained so much"]],[2931,["and have betrayed us – [it] doesn’t matter,","[it’s] not important."]],[2937,["Because they are going to be losers,","not we."]],[2943,["So, there’s nothing to bother about","these things."]],[2948,["Then another thing is: try to see that","your mind doesn’t react."]],[2954,["Some people have a habit, or I think most","of them have, to react."]],[2960,["You tell them something, they’ll put their","own one tail with it, something."]],[2967,["Never will they accept if somebody","says something."]],[2972,["If you are reacting, what will go into","your heads? What will go into your heart?"]],[2977,["What will go into your attention?"]],[2981,["So the reaction itself is a sign of not","proper development within yourself."]],[2989,["This attention which is trying to go","into all the areas of your mind"]],[2994,["and your body and everywhere, is not there."]],[2999,["It cannot enter, because as soon as","it tries to enter, you shut it by reacting."]],[3008,["You cannot see anything just for seeing","sake, you must react."]],[3014,["You say, “This is not good, that’s not","good.”"]],[3018,["If I say, “It's 5 o’clock”, you’ll say,","“No, it is 5 past, 2 minutes, 3 seconds.”"]],[3027,["This comes with terrible conditioning","which has to go away."]],[3032,["Not to react. Why should you react?"]],[3038,["Then the argument starts, then fight","starts, then wars come in."]],[3046,["If you tell your mind,"]],[3048,["“Nothing doing, you are a myth and I am","not going to react to anything!”"]],[3053,["99. 9% problems will be solved."]],[3064,["Then the last, but not the least is","the ego."]],[3069,["I can’t understand a saint having a ego,","just can’t understand."]],[3081,["It’s so stupid to have ego."]],[3086,["It’s a kind of a domination, if slightest","things are wrong, you get angry."]],[3094,["If somebody says something, you get angry."]],[3098,["That means your power of love and","compassion is still not full."]],[3107,["You can, of course, correct people","when they have to be corrected,"]],[3112,["but for that you should have this power","within yourself."]],[3118,["The person should know that you are","correcting that person"]],[3121,["because you love that person,","not for selfishness, not for any gain."]],[3128,["But this ego is a very big problem","and that comes up"]],[3133,["by, I should say, not only ignorance","but stupid ideas about yourself."]],[3145,["If you think you are something great,","already, then what can you do?"]],[3153,["Ego makes you very arrogant, horrible."]],[3159,["But if you are humble, really, not to just","to have the humility of a businessman,"]],[3165,["but if you are humble from within yourself,"]],[3169,["from your heart, enjoying your humility,"]],[3176,["then this ego can run away."]],[3180,["You have to ask yourself, “Now what","are you angry for?”"]],[3183,["Again I come back to the same point:","introspection."]],[3188,["Because you are not here just to carry on","some jobs,"]],[3193,["but you are here to become saints."]],[3198,["Then this ego should be made into a great","instrument of love and joy."]],[3208,["You can, it's not difficult."]],[3212,["This one is what is ego is, reactions","to things."]],[3220,["You can react to things in a sweet way","or you can react to things in a deadly way."]],[3229,["Then [the] humour comes in."]],[3233,["Also you speak as if there is fragrant","flowers which are coming out."]],[3243,["Then every action of yours, everything","becomes very gentle and sweet."]],[3250,["Have this ego that will be gentle,","will be kind, will be sweet,"]],[3258,["will be forgiving, will be loving.","Let’s have this ego."]],[3264,["Start with this kind of a ego – the other","way round."]],[3268,["You’ll be surprised how you can really","conquer the whole world."]],[3274,["On this day of Guru Puja, is, Guru is","supposed to tell something"]],[3280,["to his disciples about correcting","themselves."]],[3284,["In My own sweet way I’ve said to you","which you shouldn’t mind."]],[3289,["I don’t mean to condemn you by any chance","but to give you"]],[3293,["a proper sense of introspection, proper","sense of introspection"]],[3298,["by which you all get your Gurupada."]],[3303,["My only, I shouldn’t say desire, because","I don’t have desires."]],[3311,["So My only vision is, that I should see","all the Sahaja Yogis"]],[3316,["drenched in the power of love, enjoying","each other's love,"]],[3323,["enjoying each other's relationship, and","improving relationships."]],[3331,["I know there are problematic people,","I know, they are problematic,"]],[3336,["but if you cannot solve the problem","what’s the use of your become masters?"]],[3344,["So, I leave it to you to solve"]],[3351,["your own problems which you are facing.","And introspection,"]],[3359,["with love and compassion, not by condemning","yourself, I am sure you can manage it."]],[3367,["May God bless you."]],[3402,["Shri Mataji: Is there warm water for...?"]],[3466,["Guido: All the children from five to twelve","years old."]],[3470,["I bambini dai cinque ai dodici anni."]],[3474,["Les enfants entre cinq and douze ans."]],[3523,["Yogini (in Russian): All the children from","five to twelve years old can come."]],[3585,["Guido: Shri Ganesha’s mantra."]],[3618,["[Ganesha Atharva Sheersha]"]],[3971,["[Ganesha Sthuti]"]],[4418,["Italian Yogi: Hindi 49. Hindi quarantanove."]],[4426,["[Namami Shri Ganaraja Dayala]"]],[4938,["Yogi: All the leaders come to the stage."]],[4950,["All the leaders."]],[5057,["Yogi 2: These are praises to the Guru –"]],[5068,["these are praises to the Guru, Shri Mataji,","from Shri Gyaneshwara."]],[5077,["1) Salutations to You, O Guru Mauli."]],[5081,["You are famous as One who generously","showers on Your children"]],[5087,["the immaculate and eternal joy, Nirananda."]],[5101,["[Long pause, during which Shri Mataji says","something to somebody on stage,"]],[5115,["then Yogi Mahajan repeats]"]],[5175,["Salutations to You, O Guru Mauli."]],[5179,["You are famous as One who generously","showers on Your children"]],[5184,["the immaculate and eternal joy, Nirananda."]],[5189,["Sakshat Shri Guru Sakshat"]],[5192,["Shri Adi Shakti Mataji Shri Nirmala Devi."]],[5196,["Please repeat all of you."]],[5198,["2) O Guru Mauli, the compassionate One,"]],[5202,["when the snake of sensuality takes a grip","on us, and stings us,"]],[5209,["the poison which is difficult to be removed","takes away our awareness."]],[5215,["But O Mother, with Your just one glance,","that poison vanishes,"]],[5222,["and we get back our awareness."]],[5225,["Yogis: Sakshat Shri Adi Guru Sakshat"]],[5229,["Shri Mataji Shri Nirmala Devi","namoh namaha."]],[5234,["(Shri Mataji says something).","Yogi: Yes, everything."]],[5237,["The second part everybody should say","together. (Shri Mataji says something) Yes."]],[5245,["3) Shri Mataji, our most beloved Guru,"]],[5249,["when we have the flood of Your ambrosia,"]],[5253,["how can the heat of mundane life","torment us, or the grief overcome us?"]],[5260,["Yogis: Sakshat Shri Adi Guru Sakshat"]],[5264,["Shri Adi Shakti Mataji Shri Nirmala Devi","namoh namaha."]],[5271,["4) O most loving Guru, it is by Your grace"]],[5275,["that, we Your children, are eternally","enjoying the bliss of Yoga,"]],[5280,["and it is You who most lovingly bestow","upon us"]],[5284,["the enlightened of «So-ham», «I am that»."]],[5289,["Yogis: Sakshat Shri Adi Guru Sakshat"]],[5293,["Shri Adi Shakti Mataji Shri Nirmala Devi","namoh namaha."]],[5299,["5) O Mother, You bring upon Your children","with love"]],[5303,["in Your lap of supporting Shakti"]],[5306,["and put them to the yogic sleep","in the cradle of Your heart."]],[5311,["Yogis: Sakshat Shri Adi Guru Sakshat"]],[5313,["Shri Adi Shakti Mataji Shri Nirmala Devi","namoh namaha."]],[5319,["6) You bless us with Aarti where flame","is the Spirit,"]],[5324,["and give us two toys of Mana Shakti","and Prana Shakti to play with."]],[5331,["Also, Mother, You adorn us with","the ornaments of spiritual bliss."]],[5336,["Yogis: Sakshat Shri Adi Guru Sakshat"]],[5340,["Shri Adi Shakti Mataji Shri Nirmala Devi","namoh namaha."]],[5345,["7) O Guru Mauli, You give us the food","of Your ambrosia,"]],[5351,["sing to us the lullaby of Anahat sound,","«So-ham» «Ham-sa»"]],[5357,["and put us in the meditative sleep,","with the enlightenment of Spirit."]],[5362,["Yogis: Sakshat Shri Adi Guru Sakshat"]],[5365,["Shri Adi Shakti Mataji Shri Nirmala Devi","namoh namaha."]],[5371,["8) O Shri Mataji, our Guru, You are","the Mother of all the seekers,"]],[5376,["all Vidyas originate from Your Lotus Feet."]],[5380,["Kindly allow us to be always in the refuge","of Your Lotus Feet."]],[5386,["Yogis: Sakshat Shri Adi Guru Sakshat"]],[5389,["Shri Adi Shakti Mataji Shri Nirmala Devi","namoh namaha."]],[5395,["9) Shri Mataji, when You grant to us","Your shelter of compassion,"]],[5400,["we become experts in Divine knowledge,","Shuddha Vidya."]],[5404,["Yogis: Sakshat Shri Adi Guru Sakshat"]],[5407,["Shri Adi Shakti Mataji Shri Nirmala Devi","namoh namaha."]],[5415,["10) Salutations to You, O Guru Shri Mataji,"]],[5419,["the Shuddha Vidya grows in the shelter","of Your Lotus Feet."]],[5423,["Shri Mataji, Your Lotus Feet are verily","our Spirit."]],[5428,["Yogis: Sakshat Shri Adi Guru Sakshat"]],[5431,["Shri Adi Shakti Mataji Shri Nirmala Devi","namoh namaha."]],[5437,["11) Salutations to You, Shri Mataji."]],[5440,["Your mere remembrance bestows command","over the universe of words."]],[5446,["We get the power of effective expression","of subtle feelings through words,"]],[5451,["and the Divine knowledge comes on the tip","of the tongue."]],[5456,["Yogis: Sakshat Shri Adi Guru Sakshat"]],[5459,["Shri Adi Shakti Mataji Shri Nirmala Devi","namoh namaha."]],[5465,["12) Salutations to You, Shri Mataji."]],[5469,["Your mere remembrance makes one’s speech","so sweet"]],[5473,["that it would surpass even the nectar","in its sweetness,"]],[5477,["and all the rasas would become","so submissive"]],[5481,["that they would readily become manifest","through words."]],[5484,["Yogis: Sakshat Shri Adi Guru Sakshat"]],[5487,["Shri Adi Shakti Mataji Shri Nirmala Devi","namoh namaha."]],[5493,["13) Salutations to You, Shri Mataji."]],[5496,["By Your grace, such words come","to Your children"]],[5500,["as that can properly express deeper","experience"]],[5504,["and subtle revelations coming from Spirit."]],[5507,["Yogis: Sakshat Shri Adi Guru Sakshat"]],[5511,["Shri Adi Shakti Mataji Shri Nirmala Devi","namoh namaha."]],[5516,["14) Salutations to You, Shri Mataji."]],[5519,["When our hearts are at Your Lotus Feet,"]],[5522,["we are blessed with great luck, Divine","knowledge and the Realization."]],[5527,["Yogis: Sakshat Shri Adi Guru Sakshat"]],[5530,["Shri Adi Shakti Mataji Shri Nirmala Devi","namoh namaha."]],[5536,["15) Salutations to You, Shri Mataji."]],[5539,["You are the greatest of all Gods,"]],[5541,["You are the sun that gives the light","of the enlightened knowledge."]],[5547,["It is by Your grace that the joyous life","of Nirananda"]],[5551,["has dawned upon Your children."]],[5553,["Yogis: Sakshat Shri Adi Guru Sakshat"]],[5556,["Shri Adi Shakti Mataji Shri Nirmala Devi","namoh namaha."]],[5562,["16) Salutations to You, Shri Mataji.","You are the shelter"]],[5566,["where all Your children feel safe","and relaxed."]],[5570,["You manifest subtle revelations of «So-ham»","in the hearts of Your children."]],[5576,["You are like the Ocean within whom","rise and recede all the Lokas."]],[5582,["Yogis: Sakshat Shri Adi Guru Sakshat"]],[5585,["Shri Adi Shakti Mataji Shri Nirmala Devi","namoh namaha."]],[5591,["17) Salutations to You, Shri Mataji."]],[5594,["You are prompt to rescue Your children","when they are in trouble."]],[5598,["You are the eternal Ocean of compassion."]],[5602,["All the Divine knowledge is Your","inalienable compassion."]],[5608,["Yogis: Sakshat Shri Adi Guru Sakshat"]],[5611,["Shri Adi Shakti Mataji Shri Nirmala Devi","namoh namaha."]],[5617,["18) Salutations to You, Shri Mataji."]],[5620,["When we are involved in the play","of Your maya,"]],[5623,["we feel as if this mundane world is real."]],[5627,["But when You manifest Your Brahma rupa,","example Your true form,"]],[5633,["example Your true form of Supreme","God Almighty,"]],[5636,["we realise that Mother, You are","the Omnipresent."]],[5640,["Yogis: Sakshat Shri Adi Guru Sakshat"]],[5643,["Shri Adi Shakti Mataji Shri Nirmala Devi","namoh namaha."]],[5649,["19) Salutations to You, Shri Mataji."]],[5651,["When a magician casts the spell of his","magic,"]],[5655,["his spectators become oblivious to the rest","of the world."]],[5658,["But the magician cannot hide himself."]],[5661,["But Shri Mataji, in the spell of Your maya,"]],[5665,["the awareness of the truth about You","is lost,"]],[5668,["and the illusionary mundane world","is taken as reality."]],[5672,["Yogis: Sakshat Shri Adi Guru Sakshat"]],[5675,["Shri Adi Shakti Mataji Shri Nirmala Devi","namoh namaha."]],[5681,["20) Salutations to You, Shri Mataji."]],[5684,["You alone are present in everything","in the world."]],[5688,["To Sahaja Yogis and realised souls,"]],[5691,["You reveal Yourself in Your Brahma Rupa,","and give them the enlightenment,"]],[5696,["while those engrossed in maya are","ignorant about You."]],[5700,["Shri Mataji, this Leela of Yours","in relation to Yourself is wonderful."]],[5706,["Yogis: Sakshat Shri Adi Guru Sakshat"]],[5709,["Shri Adi Shakti Mataji Shri Nirmala Devi","namoh namaha."]],[5715,["21) Salutations to You, Shri Mataji."]],[5718,["It is Your Shakti which has given to water","its liquid nature,"]],[5722,["and to Mother Earth her forgiving nature."]],[5725,["Yogis: Sakshat Shri Adi Guru Sakshat"]],[5728,["Shri Adi Shakti Mataji Shri Nirmala Devi","namoh namaha."]],[5734,["22) Salutations to You, Shri Mataji."]],[5737,["It is Your Shakti that shines through the","sun and the moon in the three worlds."]],[5742,["But for Your Shakti they would not have","been like shells of mother-pearl."]],[5747,["Yogis: Sakshat Shri Adi Guru Sakshat"]],[5750,["Shri Adi Shakti Mataji Shri Nirmala Devi","namoh namaha."]],[5756,["23) Salutations to You, Shri Mataji."]],[5759,["The wind blows freely everywhere","because of Your power."]],[5763,["And the sky which is seen to be all","encompassing"]],[5767,["is only but a small part of Your cosmic","being."]],[5770,["And has to be searched as","in a hide-and-seek game."]],[5775,["Yogis: Sakshat Shri Adi Guru Sakshat"]],[5778,["Shri Adi Shakti Mataji Shri Nirmala Devi","namoh namaha."]],[5784,["24) Not just this, Shri Mataji."]],[5787,["The Maya is also a constituent of Your","Virata form,"]],[5791,["and the enlightenment is due to Your power."]],[5794,["Your form could not be understood even","by the Shrutis,"]],[5799,["who had to make futile efforts","to describe You."]],[5803,["Yogis: Sakshat Shri Adi Guru Sakshat"]],[5806,["Shri Adi Shakti Mataji Shri Nirmala Devi","namoh namaha."]],[5812,["25) Salutations to You, Shri Mataji."]],[5815,["The Vedas were said to be experts","in describing the form of God,"]],[5820,["but it was only till such time they did","not behold Your Brahma Rupa."]],[5825,["When they start describing Your pure form,"]],[5828,["they become silent as we are","in our meditation."]],[5833,["Yogis: Sakshat Shri Adi Guru Sakshat"]],[5836,["Shri Adi Shakti Mataji Shri Nirmala Devi","namoh namaha."]],[5842,["26) Salutations to You Shri Mataji."]],[5845,["As Your children have cleansed our hearts,"]],[5849,["may Your Lotus Feet be placed","in our hearts."]],[5854,["Shri Mataji, we wish to offer puja to Your","Lotus Feet in our hearts."]],[5859,["Yogis: Sakshat Shri Adi Guru Sakshat"]],[5863,["Shri Adi Shakti Mataji Shri Nirmala Devi","namoh namaha."]],[5869,["27) Shri Mataji, the feeling of oneness","has a cup of our two hands,"]],[5875,["from which we offer at Your Lotus Feet","flower buds"]],[5879,["which are our nadis and chakras and organs."]],[5883,["Yogis: Sakshat Shri Adi Guru Sakshat"]],[5886,["Shri Adi Shakti Mataji Shri Nirmala Devi","namoh namaha."]],[5893,["28) We wash Your Lotus Feet within","Ananya Bhava,"]],[5897,["example the feeling of total surrender,","and apply the sandalwood paste"]],[5902,["of dedication to Your Lotus Feet with","our ring finger."]],[5906,["Yogis: Sakshat Shri Adi Guru Sakshat"]],[5910,["Shri Adi Shakti Mataji Shri Nirmala Devi","namoh namaha."]],[5916,["29) Shri Mataji, our love for You is","like gold."]],[5920,["Let us purify that gold and make anklets","from it"]],[5925,["and tie them around Your ankles."]],[5927,["Yogis: Sakshat Shri Adi Guru Sakshat"]],[5931,["Shri Adi Shakti Mataji Shri Nirmala Devi","namoh namaha."]],[5937,["30) Shri Mataji, with the same gold","which is our love,"]],[5941,["we make toe rings and put them","in Your toes."]],[5945,["Yogis: Sakshat Shri Adi Guru Sakshat"]],[5948,["Shri Adi Shakti Mataji Shri Nirmala Devi","namoh namaha."]],[5954,["31) Shri Mataji, we offer at Your Lotus","Feet lotus flowers"]],[5959,["of Sattwa Guna, which have the fragrance","of joy."]],[5963,["Yogis: Sakshat Shri Adi Guru Sakshat"]],[5966,["Shri Adi Shakti Mataji Shri Nirmala Devi","namoh namaha."]],[5972,["32) Shri Mataji, we burn the incense","of our ego,"]],[5976,["and perform the Aarti to Your Lotus Feet,"]],[5979,["with the flame of the feeling","«I am not, Thou art»."]],[5984,["Yogis: Sakshat Shri Adi Guru Sakshat"]],[5987,["Shri Adi Shakti Mataji Shri Nirmala Devi","namoh namaha."]],[5993,["33) Shri Mataji, our body and prana are","two sandals."]],[5998,["Kindly wear them in Your Lotus Feet."]],[6001,["Yogis: Sakshat Shri Adi Guru Sakshat"]],[6005,["Shri Adi Shakti Mataji Shri Nirmala Devi","namoh namaha."]],[6011,["34) Shri Mataji, may this puja which","Your children are offering"]],[6016,["be complete at Your Lotus Feet and be","accepted by You,"]],[6020,["however inadequate it is."]],[6023,["Yogis: Sakshat Shri Adi Guru Sakshat"]],[6027,["Shri Adi Shakti Mataji Shri Nirmala Devi","namoh namaha."]],[6033,["35) Shri Mataji, we, Your children,","are eternally grateful"]],[6037,["to have been given this opportunity","to offer this puja."]],[6042,["Grief has vanished from our lives, we have","forgotten what is sin,"]],[6046,["and poverty no more exists anywhere.","We have Your holy Darshan,"]],[6051,["we have the joy of fulfillment","of our lives."]],[6055,["Yogis: Sakshat Shri Adi Guru Sakshat"]],[6058,["Shri Adi Shakti Mataji Shri Nirmala Devi","namoh namaha."]],[6128,["Italian Yogi: Hindi songs number seventy-","one. Numero settantuno."]],[6139,["[Binati Suniye]"]],[6528,["[Guru Eka Jagi Trata]"]],[7024,["Guido: Seven married ladies from","the hosting countries."]],[7030,["Sette donne."]],[7034,["Hosting, hosting countries."]],[7038,["Who have never been before to the Lotus","Feet of Shri Mataji."]],[7045,["Qualche donna italiana che non sia mai","stata prima ai Piedi di Shri Mataji."]],[7251,["Several Yogis: Ai Giri Nandini."]],[7257,["Yogi: Sanskrit songs number 2."]],[7261,["[Ai Giri Nandini]"]],[7627,["[Tujhya Pujani]"]],[8146,["Several yogis: Noida, Noida!"]],[8174,["Italian Yogi: Hindi songs number sixty-","four, sixty-four."]],[8179,["Sessantaquattro. Hindi song."]],[8204,["[Mahamaya Mahakali]"]],[8792,["Yogi: Bolo Mataji Adi Shakti Nirmala","Devi ki! Yogis: Jai!"]],[8797,["Some Yogis: Bolo Jagat Janani Mataji","Shri Nirmala Devi ki! Yogis: Jai!"]],[8849,["Italian Yogi: Hindi sixty-seven: Vishwa","Vandita. Sessantasette. Hindi."]],[9938,["Shri Mataji: Anant Ashirwad.","May God bless you all."]],[9949,["Yogi: Shri Mataji, we, all the Sahaja Yogis","of the world,"]],[9954,["desire Your good health and long life."]],[9958,["Shri Mataji, we, all the Sahaja Yogis","of the world,"]],[9963,["desire Your good health and long life."]],[9966,["Shri Mataji, we, all the Sahaja Yogis","of the world,"]],[9971,["desire Your good health and long life.","Jai Shri Mataji!"]],[9978,["Yogi: Bolo Shri Adi Guru Mataji","Shri Nirmala Devi ki! Yogis: Jai!"]],[9997,["Some Yogis: Bolo Shri Jagat Guru Mataji","Shri Nirmala Devi ki! Yogis: Jai!"]],[10073,["Yogi: Qawwali... qawwali..."]],[10136,["[Chalat Musafir]"]],[10401,["Gregoire: The national leaders are","presenting now the saris to Shri Mataji."]],[10405,["This one is from Kenya."]],[10410,["Could everyone please sit down?"]],[10413,["This one’s from Bulgaria."]],[10424,["This is a sari from Turkey."]],[10434,["Bulgaria, Macedonia, Turkey, Rumania,"]],[10447,["Japan,"]],[10467,["Egypt and Israel,"]],[10478,["Czechosolvakia and Hungary,"]],[10499,["Iran,"]],[10524,["Eritrea, Shri Mataji."]],[10532,["Taiwan,"]],[10545,["Thailand,"]],[10556,["Colombia,"]],[10568,["Mexico,"]],[10577,["Argentina,"]],[10590,["Greece,"]],[10600,["Slovenia,"]],[10613,["Poland,"]],[10621,["Portugal,"]],[10632,["Brazil,"]],[10644,["Sweden,"]],[10667,["Estonia and Lithuania."]],[10692,["One sari from New Zealand, one sari","from Malaysia."]],[10697,["Malaysia."]],[10734,["Now the international present."]],[10836,["This is a national present which","is presented by the countries"]],[10839,["which co-organised the puja."]],[10930,["Guido: As you all know, Shri Mataji has","been always trying to encourage art,"]],[10936,["to support the artists, and She is","travelling all over the world"]],[10941,["collecting pieces, trying to improve","the artisans"]],[10948,["and handicraft all over the world."]],[10951,["So this time Italy has found some art","pieces from different artists,"]],[10959,["in Sardinia, and we would like","to present Shri Mataji."]],[10965,["They are all different way of treating","the ceramics."]],[10980,["Shri Mataji: Where did you get this?","Guido: Sardinia, Shri Mataji."]],[10983,["Shri Mataji: Eh? Guido: Sardinia.","Shri Mataji: What’s this? Yogini: Sardinia."]],[10986,["Guido: This is cooked in a wood oven.","Shri Mataji: Eh?"]],[10990,["Guido: Wood oven. Shri Mataji: Wood?","Guido: Wood oven. In the oven..."]],[10995,["Shri Mataji: It’s a marble? (Unclear)","Guido: No, it's made in a wood oven."]],[11000,["Shri Mataji: Ah! And where did you find it?","Guido: In Sardinia."]],[11004,["Shri Mataji: Sardinia!","This is Sardinian. That’s beautiful."]],[11039,["Guido: The another one (?) is from Sicily.","This is all Sardinian."]],[11044,["Shri Mataji: All Sardinians?","Guido: All Sardinians."]],[11062,["Shri Mataji: All such is a... (unclear)","Guido: No, only that one."]],[11145,["Now, you see, every puja I give presents","to all the countries who are hosting:"]],[11156,["to all the ladies, all the men,","the leaders."]],[11159,["Only in Guru puja, I’m sorry, I’m not","supposed to give any presents to anyone."]],[11166,["It’s a thing when the guru, only, has","to grab everything from you!"]],[11183,["All this has to be given only on Guru puja:"]],[11186,["specially the saris, that have been given","to Me,"]],[11190,["are all to be given only during Guru puja."]],[11193,["But I’m sorry, I can’t give anything","to the leaders or to anyone on this day."]],[11203,["I hope you people don’t mind."]],[11218,["To be the guru and to be Mother is a very","difficult thing"]],[11223,["because, if you see, the gurus have been","very strict disciplinarians:"]],[11231,["they always try to discipline the disciples","and [be] quite hard with them."]],[11237,["But the mother can’t be that hard, you see.","This is the trouble with the motherhood is!"]],[11243,["That may be one of the reasons that people","take, sometimes, Sahaja Yoga for granted."]],[11249,["But you should not, because you have got","your realisation now."]],[11255,["Now you are realised-souls, you are","masters,"]],[11259,["so you should look after your ascent."]],[11261,["I don’t have to tell you what [is] to be","done,"]],[11264,["because you have the light in your hand","and you can do that very well."]],[11269,["I hope today’s lecture, you liked very much","and you don’t mind"]],[11275,["if I have said something that might have","upset you a little bit."]],[11281,["But it is a thing [that] one has to see","because we all have to grow"]],[11286,["inside and outside and we have to spread","Sahaja Yoga everywhere."]],[11291,["So we should see everyone - whether","it’s a woman or a man -"]],[11296,["we should see how many people we have","given realisation to."]],[11300,["It’s very important that you should start","giving realisation all over the world."]],[11305,["In this fashion it will spread and I don’t","have to then travel so much"]],[11310,["as nowadays I am travelling still."]],[11314,["I think, you all should take it up upon","yourself that you will do,"]],[11319,["at least if not travelling, around your","cities, around in your places of work,"]],[11324,["you can start talking about Sahaja Yoga","openly."]],[11329,["All the blessings are there, all the powers","are there, you can work it out very well."]],[11333,["Anybody you find difficult you give bandhan","and can manage things."]],[11337,["You know it very well. You know everything","about Sahaja Yoga,"]],[11340,["so I don’t have to tell you about it.","Only thing: use it!"]],[11344,["Even if you have all the instruments and","if you don’t use it, it won’t work out."]],[11348,["With all My love, with all My blessings,"]],[11353,["I say goodbye now to you, for the time","being."]],[11356,["Thank you."]],[11372,["Guido: Bolo Shri Adi Guru Mata","Shri Nirmala Devi ki! Yogis: Jai!"]]]);
